            "created_at": "2026-09-09T12:44:10.069638+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-luna-json-r2-b7",
            "text": "The show was pulled from its original Christmas/New Year slot because of the Tsunami, and to be honest it really should have stayed pulled.",
