            "created_at": "2026-09-09T12:44:10.069645+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-luna-json-r2-b7",
            "text": "Patterson and a half-dozen scientists from several institutions compiled the global map using images from NASA's historic Voyager and Galileo missions.",
